# Allowlist: the image build (deploy/Containerfile) only needs what
# `cargo build --release -p increbot` reads. Everything else stays out, so bench
# output, scratch target dirs and backups can't bloat or bust the COPY layer.
# config.rsn and prompts/ are mounted at run time, not baked in; the build only
# reads config.rsn for its persona_file, which build.rs embeds as the built-in
# persona.
# Podman won't re-include a file inside an excluded directory, so each parent
# is re-included first and then trimmed back.
*
!.cargo
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!src
!crates
!config.rsn
# Top-level persona files only, not prompts/legacy-*/.
!prompts
prompts/*
!prompts/*.rsn
# Declared as [[example]] targets in Cargo.toml; cargo wants the files present.
!bench
bench/*
!bench/persona
bench/persona/*
!bench/persona/floob_bench.rs
!bench/persona/persona_report.rs
